# Go tests, their fixtures and operator docs are not image inputs. Image provenance
# (benchmarks/sregym/fastloop/image_provenance.py) reads these lines, so a change
# to a file listed here can never invalidate a built image.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
sdo/operator/**/*.md
